  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The players must observe and remember any abnormalities from Level 0.
    There are a maximum of 4 players, each assigned to a different direction:

    one
    player faces forward, one faces backward, one looks to the right, and one looks
    to the left. To choose the exit, players must drive:

    if everything is normal,
    go right; if there is something abnormal, go left.

    Players must not make
    loud noises. If the noise level exceeds the limit, a jump scare will be triggered
    and the player will lose health.

    A white noise meter will increase when
    players make sound. If the meter becomes full, a jump scare will occur.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
